<title>MOROCCO: Moroccan Treasury auction raises 93.25 mln dirhams.</title>
<headline>Moroccan Treasury auction raises 93.25 mln dirhams.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moroccan Treasury raised 93.25 million dirhams from its weekly treasury bill auction, Bank al-Maghrib (central bank) said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Rates and amounts (in million dirhams) were accepted as follows:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	 BID	   AMOUNT	   INTEREST RATE</p>
<p>    52 weeks	  51.75	 51.75		    8.5</p>
<p>    Two years	 10	    10			 8.8</p>
<p>    Five years	11.50	 11.50		    9.5</p>
<p>    15-years	  20	    20			10.25</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    Total	     93.25	 93.25</p>
<p>Maturity date was set for April 28, 1997.</p>
<p>($1= 9.4 dirhams)</p>
<p>- Rabat newsroom +212-7 726518</p>
